stom_nodes\\ComfyUI-OldTimeRadio\\kibitz-runs\\2026-07-08-av-dialogue-video\\r1\\input.md\r\nC:\\Users\\jeffr\\Documents\\ComfyUI\\custom_nodes\\ComfyUI-OldTimeRadio\\kibitz-runs\\2026-07-08-av-dialogue-video\\r1_kling_obsolete\\antigravity.md\r\nC:\\Users\\jeffr\\Documents\\ComfyUI\\custom_nodes\\ComfyUI-OldTimeRadio\\kibitz-runs\\2026-07-08-av-dialogue-video\\r1_kling_obsolete\\claude.md\r\nC:\\Users\\jeffr\\Documents\\ComfyUI\\custom_nodes\\ComfyUI-OldTimeRadio\\kibitz-runs\\2026-07-08-av-dialogue-video\\r1_kling_obsolete\\final.md\r\nC:\\Users\\jeffr\\Documents\\ComfyUI\\custom_nodes\\ComfyUI-OldTimeRadio\\kibitz-runs\\2026-07-08-av-dialogue-video\\r1_kling_obsolete\\input.md\r\nC:\\Users\\jeffr\\Documents\\ComfyUI\\custom_nodes\\ComfyUI-OldTimeRadio\\kibitz-runs\\2026-07-08-av-dialogue-video\\r2\\antigravity.md\r\nC:\\Users\\jeffr\\Documents\\ComfyUI\\custom_nodes\\ComfyUI-OldTimeRadio\\kibitz-runs\\2026-07-08-av-dialogue-video\\r2\\final.md\r\nC:\\Users\\jeffr\\Documents\\ComfyUI\\custom_nodes\\ComfyUI-OldTimeRadio\\kibitz-runs\\2026-07-08-av-dialogue-video\\r2\\input.md\r\nC:\\Users\\jeffr\\Documents\\ComfyUI\\custom_nodes\\ComfyUI-OldTimeRadio\\kibitz-runs\\2026-07-08-av-dialogue-video\\r2_kling_obsolete\\antigravity.md\r\nGet-ChildItem : Access to the path 'C:\\Users\\jeffr\\Documents\\ComfyUI\\custom_nodes\\ComfyUI-OldTimeRadio\\.pytest_cache' \r\nis denied.\r\nAt line:2 char:1\r\n+ Get-ChildItem -Recurse -File -Include *.md,*.py,*.json | ForEach-Obje ...\r\n+ ~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~\r\n    + CategoryInfo          : PermissionDenied: (C:\\Users\\jeffr\\...o\\.pytest_cache:String) [Get-ChildItem], Unauthoriz \r\n   edAccessException\r\n    + FullyQualifiedErrorId : DirUnauthorizedAccessError,Microsoft.PowerShell.Commands.GetChildItemCommand\r\n \r\n","exit_code":1,"status":"failed"}}
